    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PixelPop 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neon-soaked chaos of PixelPop 2087 will guide you in a 2D pixel art adventure where '80s nostalgia meets a dystopian twist from the future! <br>Set in the retro-futuristic year 2087, this indie gem combines synthwave vibes, explosive action, and quirky storytelling to deliver a cool gaming experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your partner (who have rare red eyes) gets kidnapped by a shadowy sorcerer with a bizarre obsession for resurrecting forgotten monsters from '80s video games, it\u2019s up to YOU to save the day. These monsters were deleted for being too buggy or just plain weird\u2014and now they\u2019re back, wreaking havoc across the city. Armed with pixel-perfect reflexes, a dash of sarcasm, and some seriously rad gear, you'll embark on a journey through neon-lit alleys, arcades-turned-deathtraps, and surreal, glitchy battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your hero (male or female), crank up the synthwave soundtrack, and prepare to fight your way through a rogues' gallery of pixelated nightmares. It\u2019s not just a rescue mission\u2014it\u2019s a quest to stop the dark wizard's absurd plan and restore balance to a world that never stopped loving the '80s.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PixelPop 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neon-soaked chaos of PixelPop 2087 will guide you in a 2D pixel art adventure where '80s nostalgia meets a dystopian twist from the future! <br>Set in the retro-futuristic year 2087, this indie gem combines synthwave vibes, explosive action, and quirky storytelling to deliver a cool gaming experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your partner (who have rare red eyes) gets kidnapped by a shadowy sorcerer with a bizarre obsession for resurrecting forgotten monsters from '80s video games, it\u2019s up to YOU to save the day. These monsters were deleted for being too buggy or just plain weird\u2014and now they\u2019re back, wreaking havoc across the city. Armed with pixel-perfect reflexes, a dash of sarcasm, and some seriously rad gear, you'll embark on a journey through neon-lit alleys, arcades-turned-deathtraps, and surreal, glitchy battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your hero (male or female), crank up the synthwave soundtrack, and prepare to fight your way through a rogues' gallery of pixelated nightmares. It\u2019s not just a rescue mission\u2014it\u2019s a quest to stop the dark wizard's absurd plan and restore balance to a world that never stopped loving the '80s.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action-packed 2D game with rogue-lite inspired mechanics. Two characters with completely different combat styles: Elly, a melee fighter. Johnny, a gunslinger. Fight your way through, get the keys and unlock new rooms, reaching your partner!",
